### Managing list state with arrays in useState

Source: https://github.com/reactjs/react.dev/blob/main/src/content/reference/react/useState.md

Use spread syntax [...todos], map, and filter to replace rather than mutate state arrays when adding, updating, or deleting list items across components.

```javascript
